{"id":"b767163b85aaf61c","group":"90","path":"90/90-fact-paradox-equivalence.md","title":"fact-paradox-equivalence — Comparison of Diagonal Contradiction Schemes","display":"fact-paradox-equivalence — Comparison of Diagonal Contradiction Schemes","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-fact-paradox-equivalence","aliases":["90-fact-paradox-equivalence"],"display":"fact-paradox-equivalence — Comparison of Diagonal Contradiction Schemes","depends_on":["[[90-df-liar-paradox]]","[[90-df-russell-paradox]]","[[90-df-berry-paradox]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-fact-paradox-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-fact-paradox-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-paradox-equivalence — Comparison of Diagonal Contradiction Schemes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e57623a088eec9a8\" href=\"?note=e57623a088eec9a8\" title=\"90-df-liar-paradox\">90-df-liar-paradox</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbac61b28f38b09f\" href=\"?note=bbac61b28f38b09f\" title=\"90-df-russell-paradox\">90-df-russell-paradox</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"777baa75a4312c8e\" href=\"?note=777baa75a4312c8e\" title=\"90-df-berry-paradox\">90-df-berry-paradox</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> (syntax encoding), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (sentence), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> (candidate internal truth formula), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (candidate set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_k\">\\(b_k\\)</span> (least number not definable below length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Russell}\">\\(\\mathrm{Russell}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Berry}\">\\(\\mathrm{Berry}\\)</span> (the three sourced configuration predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}\">\\(\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}\\)</span> (definability-below-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}equivalence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}(L;\\tau)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash(L\\leftrightarrow\\neg L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow(R\\in R\\leftrightarrow R\\notin R),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Berry}(k)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}(b_k)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}(b_k)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}equivalence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}(L;\\tau)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash(L\\leftrightarrow\\neg L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow(R\\in R\\leftrightarrow R\\notin R),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Berry}(k)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}(b_k)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}(b_k)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>三者不是同一形式系统中的“等价命题”；它们分别依赖真理模式、无限制集合概括和朴素可定义性语义。</li>\n<li>可严格比较的是共同的对角矛盾结构，上式逐项给出各自配置推出的矛盾，而不引入未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim\">\\(\\sim\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>文件名保留历史标签；标题不再把结构类比误称为逻辑等价。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-liar-paradox","status":"resolved","id":"e57623a088eec9a8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-liar-paradox]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-russell-paradox","status":"resolved","id":"bbac61b28f38b09f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-russell-paradox]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-berry-paradox","status":"resolved","id":"777baa75a4312c8e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-berry-paradox]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"b_k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Russell}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Berry}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Def}_{<k}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}equivalence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}(L;\\tau)\n&\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash(L\\leftrightarrow\\neg L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\n&\\Longrightarrow(R\\in R\\leftrightarrow R\\notin R),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Berry}(k)\n&\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Def}_{<k}(b_k)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Def}_{<k}(b_k)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sim","display":false}],"bytes":1563,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-fact-diagonal-function-recursive.md]]\n[[90-fact-godel-number-effective.md]]\n[[90-fact-normal-system-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-fact-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[90-fact-paradox-equivalence.md]]\n[[90-fact-proof-predicate-pr.md]]\n[[90-fact-representation-implies-numeralwise.md]]"}],"outgoing":["e57623a088eec9a8","bbac61b28f38b09f","777baa75a4312c8e"]}